SIDES - Computah OS library
(generated from docs/API.md)

Side numbers for redstone and side-based methods;
they match Minecraft's directions. Names map to
numbers and numbers to names.

Number - Names
0 - bottom, down, negy
1 - top, up, posy
2 - north, back, negz
3 - south, front, forward, posz
4 - west, right, negx
5 - east, left, posx

The relative names (front, back, left, right)
exist for OpenComputers programs; computers have
no facing, so they always mean the compass
directions above.
